SUMMARY:CoffeeTue- PP Coffee Company New Holland (28R) C/D Pace-- RSVP req
 uired
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide Leader: (volunteer t
 o lead!)\nRide Sweep: Rick Zook\n\nCoffeeTue rides:\n• A rotating start 
 location\, not a school\n• A predetermined route\n• 25+/- mile routes\
 n• 12 to 14 and 14 to 17 mph average pace\n• “short” stop for refr
 eshment/coffee mid-route at [Coffee Company](https://www.coffeecocafe.com/
 ) (New Holland location)\n\nLike an All Class Ride\, CoffeeTue does not ha
 ve a single pace.\nAs Sweep\, Rick Zook will bike with any "D" ride cyclis
 t.\nThe CoffeeTue rides are social rides\, but cyclists are not expected t
 o stay in one group. Cyclists may pedal at their own comfortable paces. A 
 planned stop to regroup is recommended. Please be supportive of the other 
 cyclists to avoid anyone biking alone or being dropped off the back of the
  last group.\n**Be Safe\, Have Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\nClick for [Rid
 e with GPS](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/pp-coffee-company-new
 -holland-28r/)\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No ear buds. Please bring water a
 nd a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nT
 o eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club me
 mbership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride.\n\nBeing on Meetup does 
 not mean you are a club member. [Join here](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.
 net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148).\n\nYour RSVP is your agreemen
 t to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpres
 s.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984) \,\n[Rules 
 of the Road](https://lancbikeclub.clubexpress.com/content.aspx?page_id=22&
 club_id=257148&module_id=325159) \, and [Ride Waiver](https://lancasterbik
 eclub.net/docs.ashx?id=454318)\nIn case of accident\, consult the [Ride Le
 ader Guide](https://s3.amazonaws.com/ClubExpressClubFiles/257148/documents
 /Ride_Leader_Guide_2026_123357428.pdf?AWSAccessKeyId=AKIA6MYUE6DNNJ6ROIH3&
 Expires=1778249903&response-content-disposition=inline%3B%20filename%3DRid
 e_Leader_Guide_2026.pdf&Signature=pwxGJ6nqlu4w9Zj8Kj%2Fl9U5%2BBtQ%3D).
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lancaster-bicycle-club/events/3146940
 03/
