SUMMARY:Impromptu: East Pete Treat 11-12 mph
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nThis is a "fun" ride no o
 ne will be left behind. Re-grouping stops as needed.\nThe end of the ride 
 can include an ice cream stop at Sons Ice Cream at approximately mile 15 o
 f 16 (it's a reward).\n\nRide leader: Jon Hartung\nSweep: Frani More\n\nAn
 ticipated Average Pace: 11-12 mph\n\nRoute: [https://routes.lancasterbikec
 lub.net/cue/ep-east-pete-treat-16f/](https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/
 cue/ep-east-pete-treat-16f/)\n\nThe ride leader will ride at the advertise
 d average speed. This is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule a
 s the main goal. The ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group to
 gether with occasional regroupings and a sweeper may also be appointed at 
 the start. Please do not join this ride if you are not willing to ride wit
 h the group. If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be riding by yoursel
 f and encouraged to join a faster group.\n\nIf maintaining a 11-12 mph ave
 rage is beyond your current ability level\, please consider joining a slow
 er ride first.\n\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water an
 d a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\n\nTo
  eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club mem
 bership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not 
 mean you are a club member. Join here Member Signup Your RSVP is your agre
 ement to abide by the club's Code of Conduct: Code of Conduct Guidance if 
 an incident occurs: Incident Actions
